  "instance_name": "ex_future_mother_in_law",
  "label": "Ex Future Mother-in-Law",
  "description": "A term referring to a woman who was previously the partner of one's ex-partner, and thus becomes the mother-in-law of one's current partner. The term implies a complex family relationship that may involve past conflict or tension, especially if the ex-partner is no longer involved. The meme uses this term to describe a specific interpersonal dynamic that can be emotionally taxing, making the relief of no longer having to interact with her a humorous or relatable situation for some viewers.",
